  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會創業力或利",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL ENTREPRENEURSHIP VERSUS PROFITABILITY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹社會創業如何透過可行且可獲利的商業模式來解決社會問題，課程並透過實作與工作坊模式，引導同學認識社會創業的歷程、階段、資源協調、創新模式、經營管理、個案等面向，讓學生對社會創業有進一步的認識。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce how social entrepreneurship could solve social issues through a viable and profitable business innovation model. In this course, students will also further learn the process, resource coordination, innovative model, management, and cases of social entrepreneurship via practice and workshop, which in turn foster students’ capabilities as well as understandings in social entrepreneurship.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
